text FourIsland_Mart_Text_LoreleiGrewUpOnThisIsland {
    "We've had a great and powerful\n"
    "Trainer grow up on this island.\p"
    "I bet even you'd know her.\n"
    "It's Lorelei of the Elite Four!\p"
    "When Lorelei was just a tyke,\n"
    "I taught her about Pokémon.$"
}

text FourIsland_Mart_Text_IcefallCaveIsFrigid {
    "The Sevii Islands are in a warm\n"
    "region overall.\p"
    "But there is one exception you\n"
    "need to know about.\p"
    "The Icefall Cave is frigid because\n"
    "of the Pokémon that live in it.$"
}
